Z||000004||banditbalz||09-08-2001||12:16 AM||||The car is a Muncie 4 speed with a stock 2.8 (except for a K+N air filter and a holley scoop). I usually lower the tire pressure to 20 psi for better traction and launch at about 3000 rpm.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Untitled_1_1.jpg"> <P>------------------<BR>Silver 86 GT<BR>completely stock,<BR>completely fast!||||reg||1
